  "final_surface_assessment": "Quiet surfaces make the causal subject easier to find, especially the Floodline footprint/rescue, Red Current contact sequence and Nightglass giant-ray composition. The finishing pass preserves the selected story pivots; it does not repair the documented structural/state errors. RC15-P remains a deliberate exception because its eye reveal is subtler.",
