    "NG: weapon shape/line endpoint and occasional hand/prop sides vary; repaired car geography holds.",
    "BP: root/door geography and cloth-damage continuity drift; immediate release and nursery clue remain clear.",
    "ST: creature scale, charge/release side and chip continuity vary; repaired independent ride remains intact.",
    "RC: black plate/debt sides and key/permit continuity vary; earned victory and cost remain clear.",
    "FL: opposing jaw support remains unresolved; memory ripples, glove sides and key side vary; victim rescue and evidence lead remain legible."
